      "widgets_values": [
        "{\"version\":1,\"content\":\"<h1><span data-ic=\\\"workflow-v1\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" style=\\\"color: #89b4fa\\\"></span>&nbsp;<span>Crop Video Workflow</span></h1><h2><span>1. 📁 Setup Video Source</span></h2><p><span>You can provide the source video in two ways:</span></p><p></p><ul><li><span>Directly in the <span style=\\\"color: rgb(203, 166, 247)\\\">Crop Video</span>&nbsp;node by choosing a file from <span style=\\\"color: rgb(203, 166, 247)\\\">video_path</span>.</span></li><li><span>OR, connect a <span style=\\\"color: rgb(203, 166, 247)\\\">Load Video</span>&nbsp;node to the <span style=\\\"color: rgb(203, 166, 247)\\\">video_input</span>&nbsp;socket.</span></li></ul><p></p><p><span data-ic=\\\"warning-v2\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" style=\\\"color: #f9e2af\\\"></span>&nbsp;If connected, the <span style=\\\"color: rgb(203, 166, 247)\\\">video_path</span>&nbsp;selection will be ignored.<span></span></p><hr><h2><span>2. ✂️ Define Crop &amp; Trim</span></h2><p><span>Once the video is loaded, use the interactive preview:</span></p><p></p><ul><li><span><span>Crop:</span> Drag the crop overlay to find the best framing.</span></li><li><span>Trim: Move the scrubber to the desired start/end points and press <span style=\\\"color: rgb(166, 227, 161)\\\">IN Set</span>&nbsp;and <span style=\\\"color: rgb(243, 139, 168)\\\">OUT Set</span>. If skipped, the full video length is used.</span></li></ul><hr><h2><span>3. ⚙️ Configure Encoding</span></h2><p>Adjust the <span>Advanced</span>&nbsp;settings:</p><p></p><ul><li>Use <span>lossless</span>&nbsp;for high-quality archiving.</li><li>Choose a codec suitable for your hardware.</li></ul><p><span data-ic=\\\"warning-v2\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" style=\\\"color: #f9e2af\\\"></span>&nbsp;<span>Recommended for most users:</span> <span style=\\\"color: rgb(203, 166, 247)\\\">libx264</span> (CPU-based, universally compatible)</p><hr><h2><span>4. ▶️ Execution</span></h2><p>Run the workflow. The processed video will be sent to the connected <span>Save Video</span>&nbsp;node.</p><p><span data-ic=\\\"checkmark\\\" class=\\\"pix-note-ic\\\" style=\\\"color: #a6e3a1\\\"></span>&nbsp;Supports virtually any format — powered by&nbsp;<a href=\\\"https://ffmpeg.org/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\">ffmpeg</a>.</p><p></p><p></p>\",\"buttonColor\":\"#89b4fa\",\"lineColor\":\"#89b4fa\",\"width\":720,\"height\":620}",
